{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/9839de5d19f4175de6b939f1b12eb969.avif?t=1764266603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras_big/9839de5d19f4175de6b939f1b12eb969.avif?t=1764266603 width=1560 height=892 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wishlist to know when the demo goes live</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>In <strong>Snap Quest</strong>, a cozy photo adventure, you\u2019re called back to Star Island to h\u0336\u0313\u0349e\u0334\u034a\u032dl\u0336\u0309\u0358\u0319p\u0335\u0302\u033c\u00a0 your grandmother reclaim her lost research. Years of work mysteriously lost.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of an island researcher and wildlife photographer. <strong>Solve clever puzzles</strong>, <strong>snap photos of never-before-seen creatures</strong>, and s\u0337\u0350\u0324a\u0335\u0311\u0319v\u0338\u034c\u033be\u0337\u0309\u0328\u00a0 your discoveries in your very own scientific journal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore </strong>t\u0336\u0344h\u0338\u0346\u0319e\u0335\u031a\u031f i\u0335\u0350\u033as\u0336\u0310\u0333l\u0336\u031b\u0330a\u0338\u0344\u0345n\u0334\u030c\u0353d\u0335\u0309\u0329 with your unique style. Decorate, rebuild, and shape the island's future. Along the way, meet quirky locals, form lasting friendships, and uncover the truth behind the disappearing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/640af42cae0e7d9257ada391c966c8fa.poster.avif?t=1764266603\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/640af42cae0e7d9257ada391c966c8fa.webm?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/640af42cae0e7d9257ada391c966c8fa.mp4?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Camera to document your findings! Find and upgrade camera components to uncover lost scientific discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/728d8ab943bff83d0f4aae9deeae791d.poster.avif?t=1764266603\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/728d8ab943bff83d0f4aae9deeae791d.webm?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/728d8ab943bff83d0f4aae9deeae791d.mp4?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse environments, day and night, to experience the strange wildlife first hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/f2d985235994099747393d600719d0a2.poster.avif?t=1764266603\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/f2d985235994099747393d600719d0a2.webm?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/f2d985235994099747393d600719d0a2.mp4?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catalogue decor with your camera and customize the island to bring tourism back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/d928acd48f022dc5d9316a9d9f3056a4.poster.avif?t=1764266603\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/d928acd48f022dc5d9316a9d9f3056a4.webm?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/d928acd48f022dc5d9316a9d9f3056a4.mp4?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with the residents and they may assist you in your journey. Perhaps something more may bloom from your relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/7474bc770e2a00b7e83d9eafb5d89190.poster.avif?t=1764266603\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/7474bc770e2a00b7e83d9eafb5d89190.webm?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/7474bc770e2a00b7e83d9eafb5d89190.mp4?t=1764266603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W\u0338\u0305\u0326\u033ae\u0338\u035b\u033f\u0350\u0318\u032a\u031c\u00a0d\u0335\u0312\u0351\u0312\u0320\u032fo\u0338\u0350\u0312\u0324\u031cn\u0334\u0344\u0307\u0346\u0322'\u0336\u030e\u030f\u034et\u0338\u034a\u0352\u0321\u0359\u0331\u00a0h\u0336\u0346\u0344\u0358\u0333\u032c\u035ca\u0335\u0340\u031f\u0321\u0355v\u0336\u030f\u0315\u0345\u032e\u032ae\u0336\u0344\u031b\u0341\u0328\u0322\u00a0m\u0338\u030e\u034c\u0345\u0333\u0318u\u0337\u0344\u033b\u033a\u0324c\u0334\u035d\u0312\